  "Description": {
    "Cost": 2322614,
    "UIName": "Goliath",
    "Id": "chassisdef_goliath_GOL-5W",
    "Name": "Goliath",
    "Details": "The 5W variant of the Goliath is armed with two Plasma Rifles which not only inflict damage on their targets but heat as well. The 5W is also armed with three Medium Lasers for close combat. The 'Mech has a Guardian ECM Suite which is needed to properly use its sixteen and a half tons of Stealth Armor. Additionally, the 'Mech has a Small Cockpit that is cramped and makes the 'Mech harder to pilot but saves valuable weight. The 'Mech also has an Improved C3 computer, allowing it to share targeting telemetry with similarly equipped units.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.14</color></b>",
    "Icon": "Goliath"
  },
